# Agon Wastes 0b_sand_hall L0: CPillBug e00280088/89/8a (planar 1, looping 9-12 waypoint paths, no
# IS00 return waypoints; crawl vulnerability: bomb 100/immune, power bomb 200, boost 100, rest 0).
# God-mode player (u0400): a bug placed at the player (InDetectionRange -> FastPatrol), a touch
# facing the player (CollidedWith -> HitPlayer -> Pause -> AnimOver), beam shots (resisted arms), a
# real morph-ball bomb laid and the bug put on it (ResistedDamage immune -> Bombed -> Fall -> Landed
# -> Injured -> Delay -> HasReturnPath false -> Wander -> CloseToPath -> Patrol), shots and bombs at
# the injured/wandering bug, a forced Turn (every shipped path loops, so PathOver never sets), and
# a bomb kill.
@f200 god 1; give morphBall 1; give morphBallBombs 1; give powerBomb 3; give missile 50; give chargeBeam 1; give darkBeam 1; give lightBeam 1; give darkAmmo 100; give lightAmmo 100
